+Rate-limit counters for api-gateway. One pod in `order-platform`, a 1Gi encrypted gp3 disk, AOF on, password required.
 
 | File | What |
 |---|---|
 | `statefulset.yaml` | The pod and its disk |
 | `service.yaml` | `redis` (what the gateway uses) and `redis-headless` |
+| `externalsecret.yaml` | `redis-auth`: the password from Secrets Manager (`eks-v2-dev-redis-password`), as a one-line config file and as a plain key for the probes |
 | `../apps/redis.yaml` | The ArgoCD app, sync wave -1 |
